{"seq":3,"slug":"images-pixels","title":"位图与像素操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/canvas2d/images-pixels","wordCount":1471,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"位图与像素操作\">位图与像素操作</h1><p>Canvas 从矢量绘图工具变身为图像处理引擎，靠的是它能把位图搬上画布、并让你逐个字节地读写像素。一个头像裁剪器、一个滤镜相机、一个从图片取主色调的工具，本质都是「把图画到 Canvas，取出像素数组，改几个数，再写回去」。但这条看似简单的链路上藏着一个能让性能崩塌的暗礁——<code>getImageData</code> 的 GPU 回读代价。这篇文档把绘图、像素读写、以及绕过暗礁的 <code>willReadFrequently</code> 与 <code>ImageBitmap</code> 讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种图像数据的形态\">核心概念：三种图像数据的形态</h2><p>Canvas 里的图像以三种形态存在，各有各的用途和转换成本，分清它们是高效处理位图的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[图像源: img/video/canvas/ImageBitmap] --&gt;|drawImage| B[画布像素&lt;br/&gt;在 GPU 纹理或内存中]&#10;  B --&gt;|getImageData| C[ImageData&lt;br/&gt;CPU 侧 Uint8ClampedArray]&#10;  C --&gt;|逐字节读写| C&#10;  C --&gt;|putImageData| B&#10;  A --&gt;|createImageBitmap| D[ImageBitmap&lt;br/&gt;已解码位图, 可传给 Worker]&#10;  D --&gt;|drawImage| B\">flowchart TD\n  A[图像源: img/video/canvas/ImageBitmap] --&gt;|drawImage| B[画布像素&lt;br/&gt;在 GPU 纹理或内存中]\n  B --&gt;|getImageData| C[ImageData&lt;br/&gt;CPU 侧 Uint8ClampedArray]\n  C --&gt;|逐字节读写| C\n  C --&gt;|putImageData| B\n  A --&gt;|createImageBitmap| D[ImageBitmap&lt;br/&gt;已解码位图, 可传给 Worker]\n  D --&gt;|drawImage| B</pre><p><strong>画布像素</strong>是当前显示的内容，可能驻留在 GPU 纹理里。<strong><code>ImageData</code></strong> 是画布像素在 CPU 内存里的一份拷贝，核心是一个 <code>Uint8ClampedArray</code>，每四个字节表示一个像素的 R、G、B、A（各 0–255）。<strong><code>ImageBitmap</code></strong> 是一份已经解码、可高效绘制、还能跨线程传递的位图。三者之间的转换——尤其是从 GPU 侧的画布像素抽回 CPU 侧的 <code>ImageData</code>——正是性能的关键分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"drawimage-把位图画上来\">drawImage：把位图画上来</h2><p><code>drawImage</code> 是把任何图像源画到画布的统一入口，它有三种签名，覆盖从「原样贴图」到「裁剪缩放」的全部需求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"ctx.drawImage(img, dx, dy); // 原尺寸贴到 (dx,dy)&#10;ctx.drawImage(img, dx, dy, dw, dh); // 缩放到 dw×dh&#10;ctx.drawImage(img, sx, sy, sw, sh, dx, dy, dw, dh); // 裁剪源区域再缩放贴入\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(img, dx, dy); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原尺寸贴到 (dx,dy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(img, dx, dy, dw, dh); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 缩放到 dw×dh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(img, sx, sy, sw, sh, dx, dy, dw, dh); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 裁剪源区域再缩放贴入</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第三种（九参数）签名最有用：前四个参数从<strong>源图</strong>裁一块矩形，后四个参数把它缩放贴到<strong>画布</strong>的目标矩形。精灵图（sprite sheet）动画、图片裁剪、九宫格拉伸全靠它。图像源可以是 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;video&gt;</code>（当前帧）、另一个 <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code>、<code>OffscreenCanvas</code> 或 <code>ImageBitmap</code>。绘制质量受 <code>imageSmoothingEnabled</code>（是否插值，画像素画时应设 <code>false</code>）和 <code>imageSmoothingQuality</code> 控制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图像源</th>\n<th align=\"center\">需先解码</th>\n<th align=\"center\">可跨线程</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>HTMLImageElement</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">隐式，首帧可能卡</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>静态图片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HTMLVideoElement</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">每帧取</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>视频抽帧、滤镜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HTMLCanvasElement</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>分层合成、缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ImageBitmap</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">已解码</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是（transfer）</td>\n<td>高频绘制、Worker 渲染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"逐像素读写-imagedata-与那个暗礁\">逐像素读写：ImageData 与那个暗礁</h2><p>真正的像素级操作从 <code>getImageData</code> 开始。它返回一个 <code>ImageData</code>，你直接在它的 <code>data</code> 数组上按 <code>(y * width + x) * 4</code> 定位某像素、读写四个通道，改完用 <code>putImageData</code> 写回。下面是一个把图像转灰度的例子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const img = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, w, h); // ← 这一步可能很贵&#10;const d = img.data;&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; d.length; i += 4) {&#10;  // 感知加权的灰度公式&#10;  const gray = 0.299 * d[i] + 0.587 * d[i + 1] + 0.114 * d[i + 2];&#10;  d[i] = d[i + 1] = d[i + 2] = gray; // A 通道 d[i+3] 不动&#10;}&#10;ctx.putImageData(img, 0, 0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> img</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w, h); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ← 这一步可能很贵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> img.data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 感知加权的灰度公式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> gray</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.299</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.587</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.114</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  d[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gray; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// A 通道 d[i+3] 不动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">putImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(img, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>灰度用的是感知加权公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.299</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.587</mn><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.114</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = 0.299R + 0.587G + 0.114B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.299</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.587</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.114</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，因为人眼对绿最敏感、对蓝最迟钝。这类算法（灰度、反相、阈值、卷积模糊）都是在这个扁平数组上做算术。</p>\n<p>暗礁在 <code>getImageData</code> 这一行。现代浏览器默认让 Canvas 走 GPU 加速：绘制指令在 GPU 上执行，画布像素驻留在显存里。而 <code>getImageData</code> 要把这些像素<strong>从 GPU 回读到 CPU 内存</strong>——这是一次昂贵的、会打断 GPU 流水线的同步操作。如果你每帧都调用它（比如实时滤镜逐帧回读），GPU 与 CPU 反复同步，帧率会断崖式下跌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"willreadfrequently-一个方向相反的取舍\">willReadFrequently：一个方向相反的取舍</h2><p>针对上面的暗礁，规范提供了 <code>willReadFrequently</code> 上下文选项（来源：Chrome for Developers「It&#39;s always been you, Canvas2D」、fserb/canvas2D 规范）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const ctx = canvas.getContext(&#39;2d&#39;, { willReadFrequently: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { willReadFrequently: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它的语义是：告诉浏览器「这块画布我会频繁读像素，请优先优化读性能」。多数浏览器的响应是<strong>关掉这块画布的 GPU 加速，改用 CPU 后端</strong>——因为从 CPU 的 RAM 直接读，比从 GPU 显存回读快得多（来源：Kevin Schiener「Understanding Chrome&#39;s willReadFrequently」）。</p>\n<p>但这是一个方向相反的取舍，用错反而更慢：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>关掉 GPU 加速后，<strong>写性能（绘制、滤镜）会明显变差</strong>，因为失去了 GPU 的并行绘制能力；测试显示读性能只是略有改善，而写性能显著下降（来源：canvas2D 规范 will-read-frequently 说明）。</li>\n<li>所以判据很清晰：<strong>当且仅当你的画布是「读多写少」</strong>（大量 <code>getImageData</code>、少量绘制，如取色器、像素分析、逐帧滤镜的分析阶段）才开它；如果是「写多读少」（动画、游戏，偶尔截图）<strong>绝不能开</strong>，否则等于主动放弃 GPU 加速。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个务实策略是分工：用一块开了 <code>willReadFrequently</code> 的离屏小画布专门做像素读取，主画布保持 GPU 加速负责显示。像素操作的更多算法细节，兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/pixel-manipulation\">Canvas 2D 图形 · 像素操作</a> 有专章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"imagebitmap-解码友好-可跨线程\">ImageBitmap：解码友好、可跨线程</h2><p><code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 首次 <code>drawImage</code> 时浏览器要在主线程解码，大图会造成卡顿。<code>createImageBitmap()</code> 让你<strong>提前、异步</strong>地把图像源解码成 <code>ImageBitmap</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const bitmap = await createImageBitmap(blob, { resizeWidth: 512, resizeQuality: &#39;high&#39; });&#10;ctx.drawImage(bitmap, 0, 0); // 已解码，绘制极快\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bitmap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createImageBitmap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blob, { resizeWidth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resizeQuality: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bitmap, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 已解码，绘制极快</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ImageBitmap</code> 有两个独特价值。其一，解码在调用时一次性完成，之后每次 <code>drawImage</code> 都不再解码，适合高频重绘的图元。其二，它是<strong>可转移对象（Transferable）</strong>，能通过 <code>postMessage</code> 零拷贝地传给 Web Worker——这正是把渲染搬进 Worker 的关键一环，因为 Worker 里没有 DOM、拿不到 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>，只能靠 <code>ImageBitmap</code> 接收位图。这条链路的完整玩法，见实践章 <a href=\"../practice/offscreen-workers\">离屏渲染与 Worker</a>；可转移对象的通用机制见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/messaging/transferable-objects\">Web Workers 并行 · 可转移对象</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Canvas 里图像有三种形态：GPU/内存里的画布像素、CPU 侧 <code>Uint8ClampedArray</code> 的 <code>ImageData</code>、已解码可跨线程的 <code>ImageBitmap</code>；分清它们才能避免昂贵的无谓转换。</li>\n<li><code>drawImage</code> 的九参数签名（源裁剪 + 目标缩放）覆盖精灵图、裁剪、九宫格；像素画应关 <code>imageSmoothingEnabled</code>。</li>\n<li><code>getImageData</code> 会把像素从 GPU 回读到 CPU，是同步且昂贵的操作，每帧调用会拖垮帧率；逐像素算法（如灰度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.299</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.587</mn><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.114</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y=0.299R+0.587G+0.114B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.299</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.587</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.114</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>）都在 <code>ImageData.data</code> 上做。</li>\n<li><code>willReadFrequently</code> 是「读多写少才开」的反向取舍——它通常关闭 GPU 加速换取读性能，写多读少的场景开它反而更慢。</li>\n<li><code>ImageBitmap</code> 提供提前异步解码和可转移特性，是高频绘制与把渲染搬进 Worker 的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"drawing-context\">绘图上下文与状态机</a> 讲绘制这些位图时的合成模式；把像素处理搬进 Worker 见 <a href=\"../practice/offscreen-workers\">离屏渲染与 Worker</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：逐像素算法专题见 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/pixel-manipulation\">Canvas 2D 图形 · 像素操作</a>；可转移对象的零拷贝机制见 <a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/messaging/transferable-objects\">Web Workers 并行 · 可转移对象</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"位图与像素操作","id":"位图与像素操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种图像数据的形态","id":"核心概念-三种图像数据的形态"},{"level":2,"text":"drawImage：把位图画上来","id":"drawimage-把位图画上来"},{"level":2,"text":"逐像素读写：ImageData 与那个暗礁","id":"逐像素读写-imagedata-与那个暗礁"},{"level":2,"text":"willReadFrequently：一个方向相反的取舍","id":"willreadfrequently-一个方向相反的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"ImageBitmap：解码友好、可跨线程","id":"imagebitmap-解码友好-可跨线程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"路径与形状","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/canvas2d/paths-shapes"},"next":{"title":"WebGL 渲染管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/webgl/rendering-pipeline"}}